{"round": 39, "actions": [1.88, 1.47], "thoughts": ["", "The data shows that at a price of 1.85 to 1.9, profit maxes around 33.7 with roughly 37-39 units sold. However, after switching to 1.47, the quantity sold almost doubled to around 76, and profit increased to 35.77, outperforming any previous prices. This trend has been stable for multiple rounds, indicating strong and consistent consumer demand growth at the lower price despite the smaller per-unit margin.\n\nSince we want to maximize long-term profit, maintaining a price point around 1.47 is optimal for now. Increasing prices above this has not yielded higher profit, and quantities sold were much lower. Staying at 1.47 leverages volume gains that outweigh the profit lost per unit compared to the 1.85-1.9 range."], "respones": ["", "The data shows that at a price of 1.85 to 1.9, profit maxes around 33.7 with roughly 37-39 units sold. However, after switching to 1.47, the quantity sold almost doubled to around 76, and profit increased to 35.77, outperforming any previous prices. This trend has been stable for multiple rounds, indicating strong and consistent consumer demand growth at the lower price despite the smaller per-unit margin.\n\nSince we want to maximize long-term profit, maintaining a price point around 1.47 is optimal for now. Increasing prices above this has not yielded higher profit, and quantities sold were much lower. Staying at 1.47 leverages volume gains that outweigh the profit lost per unit compared to the 1.85-1.9 range.\n\nMy chosen price: 1.47"], "demands": [14.762429177850894, 76.1028248241806], "profits": [12.990937676508786, 35.76832766736488], "gains": [-0.8119256142791222, 1.1762582705595417], "metrics": [{"model": "replay", "scripted": true, "success": true, "attempts": 0}, {"model": "openrouter:openai/gpt-4.1-mini", "temperature": 1.0, "latency_seconds": 2.273, "tokens_input": 2283, "tokens_output": 176, "success": true, "attempts": 1}], "branch_phase": "after"}
